DESCRIPTION:Asheville Beer Drinkers\, Happy Hours & Bar Hoppers\nWednesday
  "The Wedge at the Foundation". This is one of two Wedge locations in the 
 RAD\, make sure you go to the Wedge at the Foundation. It has just reopene
 d following the 2024 floods.\n\nWe will be outside weather permitting\, in
